{
  "_ayuda": "Triggers: reward | command | cheer. Acciones: minecraft (comandos sin '/'), announce (mensaje con color en Minecraft), title (texto grande en pantalla), chat (responder en Twitch), wait (pausa en ms). Variables: {player} {user} {input} {amount} {platform}. Colores: black, dark_blue, dark_green, dark_aqua, dark_red, dark_purple, gold, gray, dark_gray, blue, green, aqua, red, light_purple, yellow, white. Guarda y se recarga solo.",
